<title>UK: CSFB sets warrants on 4.50 pct Eidgenossenschaft.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets warrants on 4.50 pct Eidgenossenschaft.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston says it has issued two million American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the 4.50 pct Eidgenossenschaft due July 2002.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE	  ISS PRICE	PREMIUM</p>
<p> CALL A	110.00 PCT    0.81 CHF	 1.80 PCT</p>
<p> PUT B	 108.50 PCT    0.98 CHF	 2.21 PCT</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 20.MAR.97-05.SEP.97   PAYDATE	19.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  110.15 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
